{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 13 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">配准与投影几何：可微变换、拓扑约束和 SE(3) 闭环</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Registration &amp; SE(3)</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_069_unigradicon-title\">uniGradICON</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">将 GradICON 在异质多数据集上联合训练为单一通用注册器，支持 zero-shot 与目标域微调。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Trains a single multi-step GradICON architecture jointly across heterogeneous multi-organ, multi-modality datasets to serve as a zero-shot registration foundation model.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">来自多解剖、多模态、多数据集的 moving/fixed 图像对</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D fixed/moving volume pair from any anatomical region or modality (zero-shot or rapid fine-tuning)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">新任务上的 zero-shot 或微调双向形变</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Diffeomorphic bidirectional deformation fields Φ^AB, Φ^BA</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Official repository src/unigradicon/__init__.py, lines 218–232 · PDF p.Repository source lines 218–232</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">官方原始网络配置</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://github.com/uncbiag/uniGradICON/blob/3e83a9268b09308660c4857c7956f895c1b4b7c3/src/unigradicon/__init__.py#L218-L232\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_069_unigradicon')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_069_unigradicon')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"uniGradICON original paper architecture figure, Official repository src/unigradicon/__init__.py, lines 218–232\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/0998f5b5a469a6a22393.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Official repository src/unigradicon/__init__.py, lines 218–232 · PDF p.Repository source lines 218–232</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_069_unigradicon', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_069_unigradicon\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_069_unigradicon')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_069_unigradicon', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_069_unigradicon\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">多域训练对</span><span class=\"lang-en\">training</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">联合采样不同器官、模态、分辨率和数据集的图像对</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d fixed/moving volume pair from any anatomical region or modality (zero-shot or rapid fine-tuning) and prepares initial tensor representations (training).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"联合采样不同器官、模态、分辨率和数据集的图像对\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d fixed/moving volume pair from any anatomical region or modality (zero-shot or rapid fine-tuning) and prepares initial tensor representations (training).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"多域训练对\" data-node-name-en=\"training\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_069_unigradicon', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多域训练对</span><span class=\"lang-en\">training</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">联合采样不同器官、模态、分辨率和数据集的图像对</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d fixed/moving volume pair from any anatomical region or modality (zero-shot or rapid fine-tuning) and prepares initial tensor representations (training).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按共同张量/坐标约定重采样和强度预处理\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes spatial to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"统一空间接口\" data-node-name-en=\"spatial\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_069_unigradicon', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">统一空间接口</span><span class=\"lang-en\">spatial</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按共同张量/坐标约定重采样和强度预处理</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes spatial to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"单一跨任务卷积配准网络学习通用对应与形变先验\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs GradICON within the core universal registration foundation model computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"共享 GradICON\" data-node-name-en=\"GradICON\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_069_unigradicon', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">共享 GradICON</span><span class=\"lang-en\">GradICON</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">单一跨任务卷积配准网络学习通用对应与形变先验</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs GradICON within the core universal registration foundation model computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"moving→fixed 的预测映射\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Phi_MF within the core universal registration foundation model computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Phi_MF\" data-node-name-en=\"Phi_MF\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_069_unigradicon', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Phi_MF</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">moving→fixed 的预测映射</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Phi_MF within the core universal registration foundation model computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"交换输入得到 fixed→moving 映射\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Phi_FM within the core universal registration foundation model computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Phi_FM\" data-node-name-en=\"Phi_FM\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_069_unigradicon', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Phi_FM</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">交换输入得到 fixed→moving 映射</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Phi_FM within the core universal registration foundation model computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按训练协议比较双向 warped images；跨模态度量决定可学对应\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 06 within the core universal registration foundation model computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"任务相似度\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 06\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_069_unigradicon', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务相似度</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 06</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按训练协议比较双向 warped images；跨模态度量决定可学对应</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 06 within the core universal registration foundation model computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"复合映射梯度接近 identity，保持共享模型的规则性\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs GradICON regularization within the core universal registration foundation model computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"GradICON 正则\" data-node-name-en=\"GradICON regularization\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_069_unigradicon', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">GradICON 正则</span><span class=\"lang-en\">GradICON regularization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">复合映射梯度接近 identity，保持共享模型的规则性</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs GradICON regularization within the core universal registration foundation model computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"未见任务直接一次前向预测，无需病例级优化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Zero-shot within the core universal registration foundation model computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Zero-shot\" data-node-name-en=\"Zero-shot\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_069_unigradicon', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Zero-shot</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">未见任务直接一次前向预测，无需病例级优化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Zero-shot within the core universal registration foundation model computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在目标域少量数据上更新模型以适配细结构/模态\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies fine-tuning to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"可选微调\" data-node-name-en=\"fine-tuning\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_069_unigradicon', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">可选微调</span><span class=\"lang-en\">fine-tuning</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在目标域少量数据上更新模型以适配细结构/模态</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies fine-tuning to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"双向形变与 warped image\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces diffeomorphic bidirectional deformation fields φ^ab, φ^ba via registration.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"通用配准\" data-node-name-en=\"registration\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_069_unigradicon', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">通用配准</span><span class=\"lang-en\">registration</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">双向形变与 warped image</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces diffeomorphic bidirectional deformation fields φ^ab, φ^ba via registration.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"uniGradICON Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 跨数据集共享的相似度与 GradICON 目标</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Multi-Dataset Composite Similarity &amp; Gradient Inverse Consistency Foundation Training</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"uniGradICON：核心公式 · 跨数据集共享的相似度与 GradICON 目标\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"69\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"15.17153pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.593865 -69.00913 248.457297 15.17153\" width=\"248.457297pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M6.084282-4.96271L6.401896-6.481299H1.459037V-6.322492C2.114114-6.26294 2.223294-6.203387 2.223294-5.925476C2.223294-5.766669 2.183592-5.528459 2.114114-5.280323L.893288-.893288C.71463-.297763 .645152-.23821 .079403-.158807V0H2.580609V-.158807C2.004935-.188583 1.826277-.297763 1.826277-.595525C1.826277-.684854 1.846128-.803959 1.915606-1.042169L2.530982-3.255538C2.898223-3.235687 3.116582-3.225761 3.334941-3.225761C3.722032-3.225761 3.781585-3.215836 3.880839-3.176134C4.019795-3.106656 4.099198-2.967701 4.099198-2.769192C4.099198-2.610385 4.079348-2.49128 4.019795-2.183592L4.18852